    "content": {
        "sentences": [
            [
                "David is an 11-year-old boy who loves IT (Information Technology) products.",
                "大卫是一个11岁的男孩，他喜欢信息技术（IT）产品。"
            ],
            [
                "Today his mother took him to an exhibition of IT products.",
                "今天他妈妈带他去了一个信息技术产品展览。"
            ],
            [
                "On the ground floor there was a large hall showing the communication tools from past to today.",
                "在一楼有一个大厅，展示着从过去到现在的通讯工具。"
            ],
            [
                "When they came in the hall, a video on a big screen was showing the way people communicated in the past.",
                "当他们进入大厅时，大屏幕上的一段视频正在展示过去人们的交流方式。"
            ],
            [
                "People wrote letters to express their feelings of missing friends or family members.",
                "人们写信来表达对朋友或家人的思念之情。"
            ],
            [
                "Then they needed to go to the post office and put a stamp to make sure letters could be mailed.",
                "然后他们需要去邮局贴上邮票，以确保信件能够邮寄出去。"
            ],
            [
                "Later, email appeared.",
                "后来，电子邮件出现了。"
            ],
            [
                "People could send and receive emails easily online.",
                "人们可以在网上轻松地发送和接收电子邮件。"
            ],
            [
                "It really saved people a lot of time.",
                "这确实为人们节省了很多时间。"
            ],
            [
                "They kept walking along and saw a video showing the functions of the mobile phone.",
                "他们继续往前走，看到了一段展示手机功能的视频。"
            ],
            [
                "The mobile phone is also called the smartphone or cell phone and can be used everywhere in our daily life.",
                "手机也被称为智能手机或移动电话，在我们的日常生活中随处可用。"
            ],
            [
                "People use it to have video chats with friends and family members miles away.",
                "人们用它与远在千里之外的朋友和家人进行视频聊天。"
            ],
            [
                "Distance is not a problem anymore on the Internet.",
                "在互联网上，距离不再是问题。"
            ],
            [
                "With the wide coverage of wifi, it is possible for people to know news in the web page and use various apps for shopping in their spare time.",
                "随着无线网络的广泛覆盖，人们可以在网页上了解新闻，并在业余时间使用各种应用程序购物。"
            ],
            [
                "On the first floor they learned about the development history of players.",
                "在二楼，他们了解了播放器的发展历史。"
            ],
            [
                "The players, for example, CD players, DVD players and MP3 players, changed the ways people listen to music.",
                "例如，CD播放器、DVD播放器和MP3播放器等播放器改变了人们听音乐的方式。"
            ],
            [
                "David even tried turning on a radio with a battery.",
                "大卫甚至尝试用电池打开一台收音机。"
            ],
            [
                "Later, they also went over other products like electric lights and electric cars.",
                "后来，他们还参观了其他产品，如电灯和电动汽车。"
            ],
            [
                "\"These great inventions are the signs of every age.",
                "「这些伟大的发明是每个时代的标志。"
            ],
            [
                "I'll remember them.",
                "我会记住它们的。"
            ],
            [
                "I hope I can be an inventor to invent something useful for people in the future!\" said David excitedly.",
                "我希望我能成为一名发明家，为未来的人们发明一些有用的东西！」大卫兴奋地说。"
            ],
            [
                "\"I am ready to see your great inventions,\" replied David's mother with a smile.",
                "「我准备好看到你的伟大发明了，」大卫的妈妈微笑着回答。"
            ]
        ]
    },
